{"courseId":"voa-learn-from-mistakes-b1","provider":"VOA Learning English","sourceUrl":"https://learningenglish.voanews.com/a/4283253.html","attribution":"Source: VOA Learning English · Let's Learn English Level 2, Lesson 22: Trash to Treasure, Part 2","licenseNote":"VOA-produced Learning English content is public domain; third-party agency material is excluded.","entries":[
{"id":"voa-mistake-001","text":"Welcome to class, Anna.","translation":"欢迎来上课，安娜。","audio":"audio/voa-learn-from-mistakes-b1-001.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-mistake-002","text":"I can't wait to see your trash.","translation":"我等不及想看看你带来的垃圾了。","audio":"audio/voa-learn-from-mistakes-b1-002.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-mistake-003","text":"Tell me about that.","translation":"跟我说说那个。","audio":"audio/voa-learn-from-mistakes-b1-003.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-mistake-004","text":"This stuff is not saying anything to you or me or anyone.","translation":"这些东西并没有对你、我或任何人说话。","audio":"audio/voa-learn-from-mistakes-b1-004.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-mistake-005","text":"It's what we like to call in the business: garbage.","translation":"按我们这行的说法，这叫垃圾。","audio":"audio/voa-learn-from-mistakes-b1-005.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-mistake-006","text":"But you said to bring in trash.","translation":"但你说要带垃圾来。","audio":"audio/voa-learn-from-mistakes-b1-006.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-mistake-007","text":"Sometimes trash is treasure.","translation":"有时垃圾也是宝藏。","audio":"audio/voa-learn-from-mistakes-b1-007.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-mistake-008","text":"Sometimes it's just trash.","translation":"有时它就只是垃圾。","audio":"audio/voa-learn-from-mistakes-b1-008.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-mistake-009","text":"Don't worry.","translation":"别担心。","audio":"audio/voa-learn-from-mistakes-b1-009.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-mistake-010","text":"Next week, I could teach you decoupage.","translation":"下周我可以教你拼贴装饰。","audio":"audio/voa-learn-from-mistakes-b1-010.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-mistake-011","text":"That's fun to say.","translation":"这个说起来真有趣。","audio":"audio/voa-learn-from-mistakes-b1-011.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-mistake-012","text":"All you need to bring is a clean shoe box.","translation":"你只需要带一个干净的鞋盒。","audio":"audio/voa-learn-from-mistakes-b1-012.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-mistake-013","text":"See you next week.","translation":"下周见。","audio":"audio/voa-learn-from-mistakes-b1-013.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-mistake-014","text":"Don't start without me.","translation":"别在没有我的情况下开始。","audio":"audio/voa-learn-from-mistakes-b1-014.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-mistake-015","text":"Okay, I can fix this.","translation":"好，我能解决这个问题。","audio":"audio/voa-learn-from-mistakes-b1-015.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-mistake-016","text":"What happened?","translation":"发生什么事了？","audio":"audio/voa-learn-from-mistakes-b1-016.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-mistake-017","text":"I told you to wait for me.","translation":"我告诉过你要等我。","audio":"audio/voa-learn-from-mistakes-b1-017.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-mistake-018","text":"You told me not to start without you, which I didn't.","translation":"你告诉我不要在没有你的情况下开始，而我没有开始。","audio":"audio/voa-learn-from-mistakes-b1-018.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-mistake-019","text":"Your glue is really sticky.","translation":"你的胶水真的很黏。","audio":"audio/voa-learn-from-mistakes-b1-019.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-mistake-020","text":"Next week, let's try lamp making.","translation":"下周我们试试做灯吧。","audio":"audio/voa-learn-from-mistakes-b1-020.m4a","learnable":true}]}
